      "value": "@{5f7b354f356ab03255ef6246|full_name}\n\nSmall nitpick - `Buffer.BlockCopy` copies bytes to and from arrays of any C# primitive type, not just bytes to floats specifically.  Floats were only used as an example.\n\nOf course, vectors and other Unity structs are not C# primitives, so such methods still don't apply to them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
